      "english": "Too Shocking"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小张：来，吃颗糖。我刚买回来的。",
      "traditional": "小張：來，吃顆糖。我剛買回來的。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng lái chī kē táng wǒ gāng mǎi huí lái de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Come, eat a sweet. I just came back from buying it."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小何：好，谢谢！哇！大白兔奶糖，好久没吃了。",
      "traditional": "小何：好，謝謝！哇！大白兔奶糖，好久沒吃了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé hǎo xiè xie wā dà bái tù nǎi táng hǎo jiǔ méi chī le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "小时候经常吃，太让人怀念了。",
      "traditional": "小時候經常吃，太讓人懷念了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo shí hou jīng cháng chī tài ràng rén huái niàn le",
      "english": "Little He: Ok, thank you! Wow! White Rabbit Creamy Candy, I haven’t eaten that in ages."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "When I was small I ate them all the time, it really makes me cherish the memory."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "小张：我从小就喜欢吃大白兔奶糖，",
      "traditional": "小張：我從小就喜歡吃大白兔奶糖，",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng wǒ cóng xiǎo jiù xǐ huan chī dà bái tù nǎi táng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "那么多年了，还是没变。",
      "traditional": "那麼多年了，還是沒變。",
      "pinyin": "nà me duō nián le hái shì méi biàn",
      "english": "Little Zhang: I’ve liked eating White Rabbit Creamy Candy since childhood."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "It’s been so many years, and that still hasn’t changed."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小张：奇怪，这味道好像不太对啊。",
      "traditional": "小張：奇怪，這味道好像不太對啊。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng qí guài zhè wèi dào hǎo xiàng bú tài duì a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Strange, this taste doesn’t seem right."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小何：你这么一说我也觉得，和小时候吃的味道不太一样啊。",
      "traditional": "小何：你這麼一說我也覺得，和小時候吃的味道不太一樣啊。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé nǐ zhè me yì shuō wǒ yě jué de hé xiǎo shí hou chī de wèi dào bú tài yí yàng a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "是不是新版的，和以前不一样了？",
      "traditional": "是不是新版的，和以前不一樣了？",
      "pinyin": "shì bú shì xīn bǎn de hé yǐ qián bù yí yàng le",
      "english": "Little He: Now that you say it, I also think it’s not the same flavor as when I ate it as a child."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Is it a new edition that’s different from before?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "小张：不可能啊！我吃了那么多年都是一样的味道啊！",
      "traditional": "小張：不可能啊！我吃了那麼多年都是一樣的味道啊！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng bù kě néng a wǒ chī le nà me duō nián dōu shì yí yàng de wèi dào a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: It can’t be! I’ve eaten it for so many years and it’s always been the same taste!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "小何：呀，这不是“大白兔奶糖”！",
      "traditional": "小何：呀，這不是“大白兔奶糖”！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé ya zhè bú shì dà bái tù nǎi táng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "你看，这是“太”字，不是“大”字！这是“太白兔”奶糖！",
      "traditional": "你看，這是“太”字，不是“大”字！這是“太白兔”奶糖！",
      "pinyin": "nǐ kàn zhè shì tài zì bú shì dà zì zhè shì tài bái tù nǎi táng",
      "english": "Little He: Ah, this isn’t “White Rabbit Creamy Candy”!"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Look, this is the character “tai”, not the character “da”! This is “Too White Rabbit” Creamy Candy!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "小张：这……这……！这包装和大白兔奶糖一样啊！",
      "traditional": "小張：這……這……！這包裝和大白兔奶糖一樣啊！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng zhè zhè zhè bāo zhuāng hé dà bái tù nǎi táng yí yàng a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "真是太雷人了！",
      "traditional": "真是太雷人了！",
      "pinyin": "zhēn shì tài léi rén le",
      "english": "Little Zhang: This… This…! This packaging is the same as for White Rabbit Creamy Candy!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "It’s really too shocking!"
    },
    {
