    "sentence_translations": [
      "Too Shocking",
      "",
      "Little Zhang: Come, eat a sweet. I just came back from buying it.",
      "",
      "Little He: Ok, thank you! Wow! White Rabbit Creamy Candy, I haven’t eaten that in ages.",
      "When I was small I ate them all the time, it really makes me cherish the memory.",
      "",
      "Little Zhang: I’ve liked eating White Rabbit Creamy Candy since childhood.",
      "It’s been so many years, and that still hasn’t changed.",
      "",
      "Little Zhang: Strange, this taste doesn’t seem right.",
      "",
      "Little He: Now that you say it, I also think it’s not the same flavor as when I ate it as a child.",
      "Is it a new edition that’s different from before?",
      "",
      "Little Zhang: It can’t be! I’ve eaten it for so many years and it’s always been the same taste!",
      "",
      "Little He: Ah, this isn’t “White Rabbit Creamy Candy”!",
      "Look, this is the character “tai”, not the character “da”! This is “Too White Rabbit” Creamy Candy!",
      "",
      "Little Zhang: This… This…! This packaging is the same as for White Rabbit Creamy Candy!",
      "It’s really too shocking!",
      "",
      "Little He: Oh… An awful fake product!",
